
# Glowify - Skincare Landing Page

## About the Project
Glowify is a responsive skincare landing page created
as part of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development Internship.

The website introduces a skincare brand and includes
a navigation bar, hero section, features, about section,
testimonials, and contact footer.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- CSS Flexbox
- CSS Grid
- CSS Media Queries

## Features
- Responsive navigation bar
- Hero section with call-to-action button
- Skincare features section
- About section with an image
- Customer testimonial section
- Contact and social media links
- Responsive layout for mobile screens

